# Firebase iOS Configuration

To enable Firebase in the Sample app or your host app:

1. Go to [Firebase Console](https://console.firebase.google.com/).
2. Create or select your project, then add an iOS app.
3. Enter your Bundle ID (e.g. `com.kit.analytics.sample`).
4. Download `GoogleService-Info.plist`.
5. Add `GoogleService-Info.plist` to your Xcode project target.
6. In your App entry point (`SampleApp.swift` or `AppDelegate.swift`):
   ```swift
   import FirebaseCore
   import Analytics
   import AnalyticsFirebase

   FirebaseApp.configure()

   Analytics.initialize(config: AnalyticsConfig(
       providers: [
           LoggingAnalyticsProvider(),
           FirebaseAnalyticsProvider()
       ],
       debug: true
   ))
   ```
